    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp01_03b",
      "hash64": "48745F4E027847FE",
      "text": "Ma come “insomma”, ahò?\\nStai a fà [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0D0E)]er simpaticonea simpaticona, stai. Te possino![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0D0E"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "743CA90901C5794D",
      "text": "Comunque, mo parlamo n’attimo de robba seria.\\c\\nChe te serve? Je famo vedè a ’st’istituto come\\nse divertimo noi de Paldea?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "743CA80901C5779A",
      "text": "Allora ce penso io, stai seren[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa! A fa’ caciara\\nsò ’a mejo![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "78B3E31FD517400E",
      "text": "L’ultima vorta che sò venuta qui c’avevo da badà\\naa Supercapa.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "78B3E41FD51741C1",
      "text": "Sembra ’na tipa tutta tirata, sveja... e ’nvece c’ha\\ndei momenti che taa raccomanno! No svampita...\\r\\ndeppiù! Se nun ce sto io, bonanotte ar secchio![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "416A704DF61BF9C0",
      "text": "Non si direbbe!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "416A734DF61BFED9",
      "text": "Fate una bella squadra!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "78B3E11FD5173CA8",
      "text": "Come no! Ma che nun te ricordi che se stava\\na scordà der disco da dà a Rea![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_02b",
      "hash64": "30E45317167C4B3E",
      "text": "Avoja! Semo pappa e ciccia![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "78B3E21FD5173E5B",
      "text": "Pensa che ce stanno giorni che se ne va al lavoro\\nco ’n Glimmet ’ncastrato tra li capelli. Ma se pò?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "78B3E71FD51746DA",
      "text": "Ah, me raccomanno: aa Supercapa nun je dì\\ngnente de sta robba che t’ho detto.\\r\\nChe sennò poi ’a sento io, ’a sento...[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "78B3E81FD517488D",
      "text": "Famo che è ’n segreto tra me e te. Ce conto, eh![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "770B991AADACD51F",
      "text": "Fa’ l’insegnante me piace ’na cifra. Però, ahò,\\nche sfacchinata usà tutto ’r tempo ’a capoccia![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "770B981AADACD36C",
      "text": "Quanno se tratta de lavoro, me ce metto tutta\\nseria seria, professionale.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "770B9B1AADACD885",
      "text": "Me schiaffo ’n par de occhiali e... zac! Paro\\nn’artra persona.\\c\\nComunque sò occhialetti così, eh! Tanto pe’ fà\\nscena. Che io ce vedo bene, ce vedo.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "770B9A1AADACD6D2",
      "text": "Ah, ma che too dico a fà? M’hai vista quanno\\namo fatto ’a prova orale, no?\\r\\n’Na serietà, ’na professionalità che lèvate![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "770B951AADACCE53",
      "text": "Dimme ’n po’, nì... Che preferisci, te? ’A Capsi\\nde sempre, o ’a Capsi seria seria?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "6813464A803E76FB",
      "text": "La Capsi di sempre!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "6813474A803E78AE",
      "text": "La Capsi seria seria!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "770B941AADACCCA0",
      "text": "Ma che davero?!\\c\\nAllora, dato che m’apprezzi ar naturale, vor dì\\nche maa posso pijà pure più scialla der solito![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_05b",
      "hash64": "F5796B551C9FEDA6",
      "text": "Ma che davero? Famme capì, vòi dì che...\\c\\n... preferiresti che parlassi così, in maniera\\nformale, pulita e professionale?\\r\\nPeccato che nun c’ho proprio voja![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 161,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "770B971AADACD1B9",
      "text": "Comunque... Grazie daa chiacchierata, ’o terrò\\na mente.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "535B9E15484E2CB9",
      "text": "Ammappa quanto stamo a parlà urtimamente![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "535B9D15484E2B06",
      "text": "Mo che semo più amic[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0201)]ihe de prima, perché nun\\nfamo qualcosa pe’ ricordasse sto momento?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0201"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "535B9C15484E2953",
      "text": "Ah, ce l’ho! Famo ’no scambio de Pokémon!\\nCe stai?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
